     "text": "```python\nclass Inventory:\n    def __p__init__(self):\n        self._stock = {}\n\n    def __p__add_stock(self, item, quantity):\n        if item in self._stock:\n            self._stock[item] += quantity\n        else:\n            self._stock[item] = quantity\n\n    def __p__remove_stock(self, item, quantity):\n        if item in self._stock:\n            if self._stock[item] >= quantity:\n                self._stock[item] -= quantity\n                if self._stock[item] == 0:\n                    del self._stock[item]\n            else:\n                raise ValueError(f\"Insufficient stock for {item}\")\n        else:\n            raise ValueError(f\"Item {item} not found in inventory\")\n\n    def __p__get_stock(self, item):\n        return self._stock.get(item, 0)\n\n    def __p__get_all_stock(self):\n        return self._stock.copy()\n```",
